The '''Rip_Family x Red_Legion Arena''' (currently seen as [[Frozen Dimension]]) is a giant exclusive colosseum that only spawns whenever an admin uses the '''Arena Kamui''' [[Admin Abilities|Ability]].

==Appearance==
The Rip_Family x Red_Legion Arena is a large gray colosseum-like place containing a square arena. The location is surrounded by snowstorm effects, and can appear even in the [[First Sea]] and [[Second Sea]].

==Trivia==
* This location was previously seen as '''Rip_Family x Red_Legion Arena''', but it currently appears as Frozen Dimension. According to Uzoth, the developers put the arena inside the [[Frozen Dimension]]'s area for testing purposes.
* The Rip_Family x Red_Legion Arena previously had a dome/atmosphere covering it (similar to the [[Underwater City]]), but it was removed.

